      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working at a repair shop here and just found a smartphone with a severely swollen/bloatty li-ion battery. what are the immediate safety steps i should take to handle it and how do i dispose of it properly without causing a fire?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
